Ano nga 'yon?

02:08.169 --> 02:09.087
Guilt.

02:09.170 --> 02:10.255
Oo, 'yan…

02:14.968 --> 02:16.803
May kaibigan din akong ganyan.

02:45.540 --> 02:48.376
